# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the Live page's Q (root + shape: C, Cm, Am, Height up, Spread wide,
# A7, then the bass F under it (OCT-), the root D over F (OCT+), C (both)) and R (the whole keyboard: G D F# A, C/E, its C tapped out while E is held, F alone). F3 is key 0, C5 19. Not a test of its own.
